      "workflow_id": "#V#lab_project_status_digest_workflow",
      "display_name": "Lab and Project Status Digest Workflow",
      "description": "Produce and persist an evidence-backed lab or project status digest from current Jira, repository, and represented prior-state evidence while preserving actor scope, explicit evidence gaps, and unresolved obligations without mutating external systems.",
      "content": "Read the prior durable digest, current Jira status, and bounded repository activity; distinguish tracker, workflow, and capability states; synthesise verified changes, blockers, obligations, decisions, deadlines, and missing evidence; update one stable actor-scoped digest work product; and verify the canonical Vontology read-back.",
